acceptance_criteria: "Revalidate the exact upstream publication timestamp and seven-day cooldown before choosing an eligible Sentry 11 version; Demonstrate Node 22/24/26 installed-consumer compatibility, telemetry delivery and expected-error classification with positive and negative controls; Pass static, exact coverage and release gates and document rollback to the prior supported major without losing queued telemetry"
